sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant A as Actor (commenter)
    participant API as everfit-api
    participant W as Worker
    participant S as everfit-socket
    participant M as Member client (in room)
    participant N as Member client (offline)

    A->>API: POST /api/comment/add
    API-->>A: 200 OK
    API->>W: enqueue on-comment-added
    W->>S: gRPC Emit receiver_id = forum_ID
    alt socket service reachable
        S->>M: notify_forum_indicator {groupId, actor}
        Note over M: actor == me? ignore.<br/>else paint the badge
    else gRPC fails after retries
        Note over W: silently dropped,<br/>nothing is logged
        Note over M: badge appears on next<br/>screen load from isUnread
    end
    Note over N: never receives the event
    N->>API: opens the app later
    API-->>N: isUnread from Mongo, badge correct
